<section class="pos-rel">
	<div class="container-fluid container-custom">
    	<div class="row mt-100">
    		<div class="col-md-12 common-heading-section para-wrap">
    			    				<div class="common-subtitle-sec">
    					<h2>It takes an unbreakable will to pioneer an entire industry.</h2>
    				</div>
    				<div class="common-body-sec">
    					<p>At Kirloskar Ferrous Industries Limited (KFIL), we take immense pride in being a
cornerstone of India’s manufacturing industry since our inception in 1991. Born from
a vision to revolutionize the pig iron and grey iron casting industry, we stand tall on
the foundation of a 130-year engineering legacy from our parent company. This
legacy fuels our commitment to innovation, precision, and customer-centricity.</p>
    				</div>
    				<div class="common-html-content">
    					<div class="row mb-xs-20">
<div class="col-sm-12 col-xs-12">
<div class="row custom-bullets">
<div class="col-sm-12">
<p>Our journey began with a focus on transforming casting solutions for industries such as tractors, automobiles, and diesel engines. Over the years, we have grown to become one of India’s largest manufacturers of pig iron and castings, with cutting- edge facilities in Koppal, Hiriyur, and Solapur. These state-of-the-art plants produce a diverse range of products, from grey iron castings weighing up to 1,000 kilograms to various grades of pig iron, including SG iron grade, basic steel grade, and foundry grade.<br />
<br />
Our products are integral to some of the world’s largest automobile manufacturers and critical industries. Cylinder blocks, head castings, and housing from our foundries find applications across engines in construction machines, farm equipment, and utility vehicles. Furthermore, our pig iron is the backbone for high- quality cast iron used in countless industrial applications.<br />
<br />
Our commitment to innovation is unyielding. With advanced 3D printing capabilities, we accelerate product development and adapt swiftly to the evolving needs of our clients. The addition of a coke oven manufacturing facility with waste-heat recovery power exemplifies our sustainable approach to growth, ensuring we not only deliver excellence but also contribute to a greener future.<br />
<br />
The recent merger with ISMT Limited marked a new chapter in our journey. As the only company in Asia with an integrated business model spanning from mines to machined castings, and now mines to steel and seamless tubes, we are uniquely positioned to serve our customers with unmatched quality and efficiency. This merger expands our portfolio to include alloy steels and seamless tubes, which have become indispensable in industries like bearing, automotive, and boiler applications. With this merger our manufacturing footprints now have extended to Jejuri, Ahmednagar and Baramati.<br />
<br />
At KFIL, our vision is forged in the fires of our forges — a place where precision and quality meet resilience and innovation. As we continue to expand, our focus remains steadfast: to meet and exceed customer expectations while driving sustainability and operational excellence.<br />
&nbsp;</p>
</div>

<div class="col-sm-6 col-xs-12 mb-40">
<h2>Our Values</h2>

<div class="row">
